<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1563_5649.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, sampt was wir ehren, liebs unnd
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermoegen zuevor, from, fürsichtig, Ehrsam, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Insun=</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>ders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüw</unclear> lieb <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoßsen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnß</unclear> berichtet <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwer</unclear> lieber Burger der Ehrnhafft,
<lb n="5"/><persName resp="#ner">Hannß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Connradt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hueber</unclear></persName>, was maßen er, uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwers</unclear> Bur=
<lb n="6"/>gers, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Josts</unclear></persName>, alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkaufften</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wein</unclear>, umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewüßer</unclear> an
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> habender schuldforderung willen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jüngst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwichnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">May=</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ens</unclear> einen arrest gelegt, der hoffnung, weil er zue seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß=</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stannd</unclear> durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vielfaltig</unclear> angewendte güetliche mittel, nit ge=
<lb n="10"/>lanngen moegen, darbey einmahl <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuewerden</unclear> etc. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weilen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>unnd aber er <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jost</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear> <date resp="#ner">7. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ditz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berüerts</unclear> Monats Mayen</date> ange=
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lobt</unclear>: Inner 8. tagen darnach sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">persoonlich</unclear> oder durch seinen
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volmächtigen</unclear> anwaldt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnfehlbarlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> zue=
<lb n="14"/>stellen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> güetlich oder rechtlichen zue contentiren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wer</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solich</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgeben</unclear>, zuesagen unnd versprechen, der arrest
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> geöffnet unnd relaxirt worden, Aber seithero, mit
<lb n="17"/>nit geringer seiner verwunderung, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nienenher</unclear> erschienen:
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hatt</unclear> unnß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear> umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Interceßion</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> an Eüch,
<lb n="19"/>das Ir gedachten Eüwern Burgern dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepietlich</unclear> anhalten
<lb n="20"/>wellen, das er Ime umb sein an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inne</unclear> habende <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtmäßige</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>anforderung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernüeglichen</unclear> willen machen, oder sich, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angelobt=</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>unnd versprochner maßen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnverzogenlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>stellen solle etc. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnderthänniges</unclear> vleißes <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angeruefft</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepeten</unclear>:
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohngezweiffelter</unclear> hoffnung deren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruchtparlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegenüeßsen</unclear>.
<lb n="25"/>Wann dann wir diß sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pittliches</unclear> ansuechen nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohnzimblich</unclear> sein
<lb n="26"/>befunden, Unnd wir den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßern</unclear> Inn dergleichen recht=
<lb n="27"/>mäßig unnd pillichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hanndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pieten</unclear> unnd Ober=
<lb n="28"/>kheitliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hülff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuebeweisen</unclear> unnd erzeigen, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> alß
<lb n="29"/>schuldig, Alß haben wir Ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geünstigklichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuewilfahren</unclear> nit
<lb n="30"/>umbgehn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1563_5650.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gelangt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnössisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergit=</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>lichs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansinnen</unclear> unnd begeren an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear>, Ir wellen denn
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> obgenant, von oberkheit wegen zuo der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villichkeit</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>unnd daß Er sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethonne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelüpt</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprechen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohn=</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>uerlengt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würcklichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volnziehe</unclear>, sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbigem</unclear> gemaeß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">instele</unclear>, oder aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> unnsern umb sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an=</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprach</unclear>, durch anndere mittel, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uernüeglichen</unclear> willen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mache</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/>anweisen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermögen</unclear>. Alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solcher</unclear> massen, es sich,
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> Rechts unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villichkeit</unclear> wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepürt</unclear>, unnd wir ein
<lb n="40"/>sonders guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertrüwen</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> haben: Als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würt</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>der unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> diß unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Intercession</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreiben</unclear>, seiner
<lb n="42"/>trostlichen hoffnung nach, ersprießlich gewesen sein, Im
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werckh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spüren</unclear>, sich dessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rüemen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfröwen</unclear> haben
<lb n="44"/>mögen. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seyen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirs</unclear> mit gleichem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerwidern</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> auch Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeneme</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnössisches</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>gefallen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntschafft</unclear> zuerweisen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> woll
<lb n="47"/>geneigt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Goettlicher</unclear> Allmacht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wohl=</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fearthig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entpfelendt</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1607-07-18" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sambstags</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> 18 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ten</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>Julij Anno 1607</origDate>.
<lb n="50"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd Raht
<lb n="51"/>der Statt Schaffhausen</orgName>.∣.
